stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> admitted : tokens reserved
  admitted --> leased : a worker claims it
  admitted --> cancelled : cancelled while queued
  leased --> running : worker starts
  running --> succeeded : answer produced
  running --> failed : error or budget used up
  running --> cancelled : cancel request
  leased --> failed : worker lost
  running --> failed : worker lost
  succeeded --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
